{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDEwLS1CZWZvcmUvVGhlLUxvc3QtUm9vbS0lMjhUVi1NaW5pLVNlcmllcy0yMDA2LSUyOS03MjBwLw","type":"series","name":"The Lost Room","description":"A detective investigates a mysterious motel room, which acts as a portal to an alternate universe.\n\nRated TV-PG · Ended · First aired 11 Dec 2006 · United States · Language: English · 90 min\nStudio: Motel Man Productions, Lionsgate Television · Network: Syfy\n\nComplete series. On your server: S1 3/3\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2006","genres":["Mystery","Sci-Fi & Fantasy","English"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDEwLS1CZWZvcmUvVGhlLUxvc3QtUm9vbS0lMjhUVi1NaW5pLVNlcmllcy0yMDA2LSUyOS03MjBwLw.1.1","title":"The Key and the Clock","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2006-12-11T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Detective Joe Miller finds himself on a  case involving two men that are found burned to death in a pawn shop, apparently involving a mysterious key and a deal gone bad. After receiving the key, Joe discovers that it is just one of nearly one hundred objects with supernatural powers and a link to a hidden motel room. Detective Joe Miller and the Wiesel try to get the clock from object collector Karl Reutzfeld's hands. Joe gets accused of his partner's murder.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3yP2QOj1PXNjbShUHTmaneochJc.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDEwLS1CZWZvcmUvVGhlLUxvc3QtUm9vbS0lMjhUVi1NaW5pLVNlcmllcy0yMDA2LSUyOS03MjBwLw.1.2","title":"The Comb and the Box","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2006-12-12T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Joe Miller is on the run after being framed for his partner's murder. He joins forces with Legion member Jennifer Bloom to find the Object that will help find his daughter, Anna. Along the way they learn about the Room's mysterious past.Martin Ruber searches for an object to gain membership in the Order of the Reunification.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pgBogY2IPehBkpoirWhT2OUNxtf.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDEwLS1CZWZvcmUvVGhlLUxvc3QtUm9vbS0lMjhUVi1NaW5pLVNlcmllcy0yMDA2LSUyOS03MjBwLw.1.3","title":"The Eye and the Primary Object","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2006-12-13T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"After discovering the existence of The Occupant of Room 10, Joe attempts to find him and another object that will allow him to access the Vault. Kreutzfeld hatches a plan that could destroy the world. Ruber has a vision while in the desert, and Joe finally finds The Occupant.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9bdgl6MqxlaiXl2qOUBZBRek3aL.jpg"}],"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/ixfo1ysvboBxYehdDDC9D0T3Q33.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jVshEAWP068E4tp4ewjIHFKB7Iz.jpg","imdbRating":"7.7","imdb_id":"tt0830361","moviedb_id":3868,"tmdbId":3868,"runtime":"90 min","cast":["Peter Krause","Julianna Margulies","Peter Jacobson","Dennis Christopher","Chris Bauer","Elle Fanning","Kevin Pollak","Roger Bart"],"director":["Christopher Leone"],"released":"2006-12-11T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Some doors are better left closed.","country":"United States","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Christopher Leone","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hI3K3i0pPlEqcdc4YxLxoUjqlNP.jpg"},{"name":"Peter Krause","character":"Joe Miller","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vjTIKHUBceaM3cBbtwwDE8mgaKn.jpg"},{"name":"Julianna Margulies","character":"Jennifer Bloom","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/erBzXAfkPCcW9sW2cGAcY50RdPm.jpg"},{"name":"Peter Jacobson","character":"Wally Jabrowski","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/pGi9CnzEG4cLa2viUP89yvlPCyR.jpg"},{"name":"Dennis Christopher","character":"Dr. Martin Ruber","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bZMnSpQ6KEBuwUfnngNEpmqhEK.jpg"},{"name":"Chris Bauer","character":"Lou